# Only what the Dockerfile copies. CDK hashes this directory for the image asset, so anything else
# (.venv, test caches, egg-info) would change the hash and redeploy the simulator service, which
# resets its task count (scripts/simulator.sh off) on a deploy that changed nothing.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!watchdog_sim/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
